<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:space="preserve"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="musicName" value="銀腕・アガートラーム"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="マリア・カデンツァヴナ・イヴ(CV:日笠陽子)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="戦姫絶唱シンフォギア キャラクターソングコンプリートBOX"/><amll:meta key="album" value="戦姫絶唱シンフォギアGX キャラクターソング7"/><amll:meta key="lyricist" value="上松範康"/><amll:meta key="composer" value="上松範康"/><amll:meta key="arranger" value="岩橋星実"/><amll:meta key="arranger" value="Evan Call"/><ttm:agent xml:id="v1" type="character"><ttm:name>マリア・カデンツァヴナ・イヴ</ttm:name><ttm:actor agent="v2"/></ttm:agent><ttm:agent xml:id="v2" type="person"><ttm:name>日笠陽子</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="line-2c1fd145-8ebb-4c6e-8998-bb59f0d6b53b">真正的强大是什么？</text><text for="line-96fe5898-2761-4fc7-8698-121fd651eac4">是骄傲？是契约？</text><text for="line-7b55ee12-aff4-41e9-8e34-8c224465cb19">向回忆中的微笑</text><text for="line-c5028081-6877-4953-8c99-07daa27fb2cd">手中依然残留的温度</text><text for="line-9e0f0778-6055-4655-baf4-770261a61d21">在困惑 迷茫 痛苦中</text><text for="line-40b39532-e4b9-42ef-b07a-71cf5fa93412">剜出罪孽 不去隐藏与逃避</text><text for="line-f341a6f4-0d9a-4adb-9bf6-56b40dfa6a8a">用原本真实的自己的声音</text><text for="line-282f33ee-ab31-46b3-9e7c-97bb74d6659e">质问勇气吧 叩击决意吧</text><text for="line-8f5f2144-91cd-426d-8cde-86e2a8f38bd2">那就是我的圣剑 高举吧！</text><text for="line-46c70e9d-bd3f-48fc-b5c3-4ebf5e359a70">软弱也没关系</text><text for="line-77bf6051-4a39-4a7c-8e2f-1d4602f927ab">流下泪水也没关系</text><text for="line-96c6b03e-a648-4e32-8297-36e2d2bd21b1">若那首绝不言败的歌</text><text for="line-f69c738f-6953-47ea-b63a-5b77c1bdaf8e">仍存于心中的话</text><text for="line-47fba3f6-1956-4447-8633-55b6daae0f15">无论命运、过去、</text><text for="line-155ad3d2-46df-4018-a3c7-2e29b6eb419e">紧紧握住</text><text for="line-72d7f674-007e-4f79-b5a5-55e1e26f1838">此刻 拼命挣扎着站立起来</text><text for="line-cc0179d2-345c-4949-b7ef-ae85e7b20cc0">找到了真正的自我</text><text for="line-d954d3da-9701-4a27-851e-1b6770e1ead7">将今日铭刻于心</text><text for="line-6551bf44-7266-4448-b34c-cc77b02fde4a">身为十字的那道光辉</text><text for="line-4d8a6f46-9131-47bb-9ebf-4139f0f7c3fc">寄宿于名中的忘却 我的正义（烈焰）</text><text for="484ae292-1e6b-4f62-b0a8-5c28c5b63433">向银色的左腕中倾注慈爱</text><text for="line-3c680c7c-9c87-4569-9949-3ece3017bd8b">撕裂黑暗 斩断邪恶</text><text for="line-9f827b2e-f23b-4a71-a5ea-b87a6a24484f">独奏（贯穿）这世界分之一</text><text for="line-64372db3-b26c-4b1e-bf99-9b78db3518c7">将脆弱的自己全部暴露</text><text for="line-454610c9-445d-497e-8375-71b2e2c599e3">就算屈膝之日来临</text><text for="line-c09e325b-a13e-488b-9358-8f0a1cfd0492">唯有这颗心 唯有这份梦</text><text for="line-91208119-8423-4a8b-b487-67f0ee3b5ef0">绝不被尘土玷污…绝不！</text><text for="line-47696112-4d38-456a-888f-9894a77f7ddf">软弱也没关系</text><text for="line-26111336-d2aa-4c54-90f8-2e423a3045aa">绝对要挥出拳头这件事</text><text for="line-9d6689ef-49ad-42b0-a19a-18e2a4b45aed">只要这双手还记得</text><text for="line-ae859523-4ded-47d1-9948-2e2c90e33a61">就算是悔恨</text><text for="line-8d079c72-7ab2-4eb5-ac82-6c14785100c2">就算是耻辱 无论什么</text><text for="line-702109ea-c4bb-415d-9fd9-d61e998e5635">紧紧握住</text><text for="line-4c61aeed-3607-49c0-ad5e-756d14a3e3bf">此刻 此身将化作烈焰</text><text for="line-4408d181-fd3e-406e-b4c2-4538af607e5f">遍染污泥的奇迹</text><text for="line-e7e5bdd0-4a34-4086-b545-b3b2f257e131">亦有上天始终注视</text><text for="line-4d112b8e-6572-4115-bbfb-c206acd69b5f">质问勇气吧 叩击决意吧</text><text for="line-c188cd75-946e-4b5f-ada6-275b09960111">那就是我的圣剑 高举吧！</text><text for="line-dd33d808-fad0-408e-916b-8ef1a81819db">软弱也没关系</text><text for="line-8907fd59-df2d-4b8a-a336-e3608be19a5a">流下泪水也没关系</text><text for="line-c76b19a0-be29-4e36-b1fe-afa702c3a342">若那首绝不言败的歌</text><text for="line-53d3f380-c20a-4a40-ac16-149736de8956">仍存于心中的话</text><text for="line-a6904cc2-2b39-4191-92f7-7b0a3bb8a822">水滴流淌的轨迹上 一定有美丽的</text><text for="line-0c75e713-f4b2-4c5a-9c06-fc53640520e6">属于自己色彩的未来</text><text for="line-880d7663-fc67-4ecd-b61a-40fcbd0027d6">正在闪闪发光…！</text><text for="line-3d00ec18-714a-4c7a-890a-d32150047246">软弱也没关系</text><text for="line-7d2ab21d-1704-43f9-b7f9-0e2efde6be84">绝对要挥出拳头这件事</text><text for="line-28c895c0-93f0-4188-880e-b0bf899f0009">只要这双手还记得</text><text for="line-4a9d3fc9-1991-4764-be87-eea383e4fc3f">恸哭、呜咽、憎恨、苦痛全部</text><text for="line-a89a0d49-1ae7-4da8-a6e5-656d74c579de">紧紧握住</text><text for="line-9ea88c8a-993b-40ea-9afa-f214ded9b6a9">此刻 拼命挣扎着站立起来</text><text for="line-a74b1c3f-bf24-4fea-b89d-9278fc679163">找到了真正的自我</text><text for="line-31e62aae-4625-4abe-aec2-70f20d196a42">将今日铭刻于心</text><text for="line-5da375e6-49fd-49dd-8594-6ebd0b678321">于此处的十字之歌</text><text for="5b92ffa9-c051-4e32-9d62-a4473426a2cf">叹息、记忆还是爱</text><text for="90047e58-a73d-4c7d-abea-79202c7d30d4">在彷徨中追寻</text><text for="124272e9-f833-43a0-a94b-16492e75de6b">仍未看清</text><text for="6c00e4c6-fef3-4813-a8f1-c60b74519a00">不断地寻问</text><text for="386a2ec6-5e3e-4bc7-8855-583ff5dfb014">绝不会忘记</text><text for="e20e9233-4119-48d6-940e-364a3fe3a7b2">意义为何？</text><text for="e82c4f39-7297-409c-aa38-46cac12b72f2">放出无双一击</text><text for="82ade451-d566-4f0b-883a-b63202fc6c53">平凡的双拳也没关系</text><text for="fad5342d-f016-4ace-9829-cb733c8a81f7">平凡的双拳也没关系</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:24.392"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-2c1fd145-8ebb-4c6e-8998-bb59f0d6b53b" itunes:key="line-2c1fd145-8ebb-4c6e-8998-bb59f0d6b53b" begin="00:22.067" end="00:25.470" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:22.067" end="00:22.500" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">真</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:22.067" end="00:22.358">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:22.358" end="00:22.500">ん</span></span></span><span begin="00:22.500" end="00:22.776">の</span><span begin="00:22.776" end="00:23.285" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">強</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:22.776" end="00:23.030">つ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:23.030" end="00:23.285">よ</span></span></span><span begin="00:23.285" end="00:23.638">さ</span><span begin="00:23.638" end="00:23.975">と</span><span begin="00:23.975" end="00:24.500">は</span><span begin="00:24.500" end="00:25.153" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:24.500" end="00:24.827">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:24.827" end="00:25.153">に</span></span></span><span begin="00:25.153" end="00:25.381">か</span><span begin="00:25.381" end="00:25.470">？</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="90047e58-a73d-4c7d-abea-79202c7d30d4" itunes:key="90047e58-a73d-4c7d-abea-79202c7d30d4" begin="00:25.470" end="00:27.547" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:25.470" end="00:25.967" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:25.470" end="00:25.833">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:25.833" end="00:25.967">が</span></span></span><span begin="00:25.967" end="00:26.287">し</span><span begin="00:26.287" end="00:27.164" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">彷徨</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.287" end="00:26.613">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.613" end="00:26.961">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.961" end="00:27.164">よ</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.164" end="00:27.547">う</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-96fe5898-2761-4fc7-8698-121fd651eac4" itunes:key="line-96fe5898-2761-4fc7-8698-121fd651eac4" begin="00:27.795" end="00:30.500" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:27.795" end="00:28.189" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.795" end="00:27.985">ほ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.985" end="00:28.189">こ</s